        "statement": "The right set of safety functions (SF-0004 provenance, SF-0006 SF-dossier gate, SF-0007 hazard-adequacy gate) is specified to mitigate this hazard; each is correctly implemented by its realizing safety requirements and those SRs are all Verified; therefore HAZ-0002 is adequately mitigated and can be signed off.",
