        "analysis": {
          "actor": "Tom",
          "at": "2026-06-13T06:11:12.299247900Z",
          "outcome": "Pass",
          "summary": "Criterion 1 (soft delete leaves status=Obsolete): delete.rs:37 sets r.status = Status::Obsolete and appends a history entry; the requirement stays in the BTreeMap and is visible via req show. Criterion 2 (hard delete refuses if inbound links exist): delete.rs:14-29 collects referenced_by and returns an error naming them when --hard is passed and the list is non-empty. Both paths tested by req_0012_soft_delete_preserves_inbound_links (cli.rs:146) which passed at commit 7107cab. Code inspection also confirms the guard."
        },
        "concluded": "2026-06-13T06:14:34.112666400Z",
