        "statement": "The delete command defaults to marking requirements Obsolete (delete.rs:37) preserving the record and all inbound links, while --hard is gated on an absence-of-inbound-links check (delete.rs:23-28) that names the blocking referrers in the error. The automated test req_0012_soft_delete_preserves_inbound_links confirms both behaviors at commit 7107cab.",
