      "id": "REQ-0017",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Could",
      "rationale": "MCP-native agents can call structured tools more reliably than they can shell out, and it lets us keep one conformance-checking path for both surfaces.",
      "statement": "The system shall provide a req mcp subcommand that speaks JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio and exposes the CLI operations as MCP tools.",
