          "kind": "Composition",
          "notes": "cites: REQ-0019 — Same temp-and-rename save path tested directly by req_0019_save_is_atomic",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
        {
          "actor": "Tom",
          "at": "2026-06-12T20:43:51.053777100Z",
