          "notes": "validation dossier concluded — Every persistence path (single file, per-requirement files, directory index) writes to a temp file and atomically renames it over the destination; confirmed by code review of all write sites and a targeted release-mode run of the atomic-save test at HEAD.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
