      "title": "Treat git commit signatures as the project authenticity source",
      "updated": "2026-06-15T07:06:55.963598400Z",
      "verification": {
        "actor": "sonnet-verify-run",
        "analysis": {
          "actor": "sonnet-verify-run",
          "at": "2026-06-15T07:06:52.891302800Z",
          "outcome": "Pass",
          "references": [
            "E:\\Development\\cli_req\\src\\commands\\audit.rs",
            "E:\\Development\\cli_req\\src\\help_text.rs",
            "E:\\Development\\cli_req\\Cargo.toml"
          ],
          "summary": "REQ-0028 has an empty acceptance[] array — it is a pure constraint. The obligation is: the CLI delegates .req authenticity to signed git commits, surfaced via req audit; it must not re-implement signing or key management.\n\nEvidence:\n1. E:\\Development\\cli_req\\src\\commands\\audit.rs:1-2 — explicit comment \"Implements REQ-0027 (per-commit signature status via git log --follow) and discharges REQ-0028 (lean on git, do not build our own PKI).\"\n2. audit.rs:38-49 — the entire authenticity surface is one git log invocation with format codes %G? (signature status) and %GS (signer name); the CLI reads and reports what git reports, adding no verification logic of its own.\n3. audit.rs:191-204 (explain_sig) — maps raw git %G? codes (G/B/U/X/Y/R/E/N) to human-readable strings; no cryptographic computation.\n4. Full grep of src/ for gpg|sign|pki|rsa|ed25519|ecdsa|x509|cert|private.key|public.key|hmac|pkcs (case-insensitive) found no signing library calls — only documentation strings, CLI option names, and git-delegating calls.\n5. Cargo.toml grep for gpg|ring|rsa|ed25519|p256|ecdsa|pki|openssl|pgp|sequoia — zero matches. No signing/PKI crate is a dependency.\n6. The linked_files listed in the dossier (./src/commands/audit.rs and ./src/help_text.rs) are both consistent with the constraint: audit.rs delegates, help_text.rs documents the git-delegation design without introducing any PKI primitives."
        },
        "concluded": "2026-06-15T07:06:55.963598400Z",
        "concluded_commit": "15977f92a2b19916ea6cd591fb7d7c8a6283de62",
