      "id": "REQ-0076",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Syntactic rules let duplicate-intent requirements through, which fragments traceability and produces conflicting acceptance criteria.",
      "statement": "The conformance checker shall warn when two non-obsolete requirements have semantically overlapping statements based on title and statement similarity above a documented threshold.",
