      "id": "REQ-0091",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Pre-0.1.2 such an edit produced a deadlock: repair refused on the conformance check, every other command refused on the hash. --force re-signs so the conformance problems surface through `req conform` instead.",
      "statement": "`req repair --confirm-direct-edit --force` shall re-sign the project file even when it contains conformance errors, so users can recover from a hand-edit that simultaneously broke the integrity hash and introduced a conformance failure.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "recovery",
        "integrity"
      ],
