      "id": "REQ-0093",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The rule fires the moment you create a `verifies` link on a Draft, training authors to ignore conformance output before there's any reasonable expectation of evidence. Gating on status >= Implemented matches the verification lifecycle.",
