          "kind": "Inspection",
          "linked_files": [
            ".\\CHANGELOG.md",
            ".\\src\\commands\\add.rs"
          ],
          "notes": "validation dossier concluded — All four acceptance criteria are satisfied at commit 7107cab. src/commands/add.rs calls find_recent_obsolete_similar (line 186) which checks Obsolete requirements updated within 60 days (line 346) using a Jaccard threshold of 0.65 — the same constant as REQ-V-0020 duplicate-intent detection. When a match is found, a warning is printed to stderr naming the prior ID (line 189) but execution continues and the new Draft is saved (line 233), so the add is never blocked.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
        {
