          "notes": "validation dossier concluded — All four acceptance criteria are satisfied at HEAD (bdd4014/rc.4): src/commands/add.rs:186 calls find_recent_obsolete_similar which enforces a 60-day cutoff (line 346) and a 0.65 Jaccard threshold (line 365, matching DUP_INTENT_THRESHOLD in validate.rs), emits a non-blocking stderr warning naming the prior ID (line 189-196), and continues to save the new Draft (line 233); the false CHANGELOG.md linked-file coupling from the now-fixed markdown-heading marker scan is dropped on re-anchor.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
