      "id": "REQ-0102",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Terse rule names like statement looks compound trained authors to ignore the conformance checker. An actionable message turns each finding into a teaching moment without changing what gets flagged. Rule codes stay stable; only the human-readable text changes.",
      "statement": "Each conformance finding shall carry a message that names the cause (e.g. \"repeated modal verb\") plus a suggested fix (e.g. \"try req split <id>\").",
