          "kind": "Composition",
          "notes": "cites: req_0131_new_scopes_findings_to_changed_reqs — Per-commit (--staged implies --new) view suppresses a weasel-word finding on an untouched req; --all still surfaces it. Verified by passing integration test.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
