      "id": "REQ-0132",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Diagnostic and throwaway scripts have no honest home today: citing a tangentially related REQ is dishonest, and REQ_SKIP_GATE=1 bypasses the whole gate. An in-file REQ-NONE with a mandatory reason lets a file opt out truthfully, leaves the rationale in the diff, and stays auditable in review --all.",
      "statement": "req review shall accept a // REQ-NONE: reason comment carrying a non-empty reason as a valid markerless-gate exemption for a source file.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "review",
        "gate"
      ],
