          "kind": "Composition",
          "notes": "cites: req_0132_req_none_with_reason_passes_gate, req_0132_req_none_without_reason_blocks — A REQ-NONE with a reason passes the gate and is listed under Gate opt-outs in --all; a reasonless REQ-NONE blocks and reports the missing reason. Verified by two passing integration tests.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
