      "id": "REQ-0134",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Safety-related projects need an enforced hazard→function→requirement chain that survives between sessions, with the integrity level underivable by an agent cutting corners.",
      "statement": "req shall manage hazards, safety functions, and safety requirements as first-class artifacts whose SIL is derived from the IEC 61508 risk graph rather than entered by hand.",
