      "id": "REQ-0139",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "A one-shot verify lets an agent assert Verified without separating analysis from testing or committing to a written conclusion; the dossier forces a rigorous, auditable verification and yields better verification outcomes.",
