          "notes": "validation dossier concluded — Every acceptance criterion is met: storage.rs guard_schema_rev() refuses to load a file whose _schema_rev exceeds SCHEMA_REV, naming both revisions in the error — since load fails the save is never reached and the file is left unchanged; files without _schema_rev are treated as revision 0 via .unwrap_or(0) at line 45, allowing normal saves. Confirmed by passing tests req_0141_save_refused_when_file_schema_rev_is_newer and req_0141_missing_schema_rev_is_treated_as_zero at commit 7107cab23.",
