    "REQ-0145": {
      "acceptance": [
        "`req verification confirm SR-NNNN` records a human confirmation on the dossier and refuses when REQ_ACTOR_KIND=agent",
        "Per REQ-0187 the agent's conclude --promote leaves a safety requirement at Implemented (awaiting human confirmation), not Verified; the human confirmation is the act that promotes it to Verified",
        "Should a Verified safety requirement ever lack a human confirmation, the conformance checker flags it as REQ-V-0034 (error) as a backstop",
        "The human confirmation is recorded in addition to the agent's analysis and testing, not as a replacement",
        "Confirming requires a concluded Pass verdict on the dossier"
      ],
