      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "The current web view shows entities in isolation, so a reviewer cannot click from a hazard to its safety functions, from a safety requirement to its verification dossier, or between linked requirements, forcing manual id lookups.",
      "statement": "The req serve web interface shall let a reader follow hyperlinks between related entities to navigate the full safety chain, spanning requirements, hazards, safety functions, safety requirements, and verification dossiers.",
