        "plan": "Re-review against current source and the existing test; confirm behaviour unchanged and re-anchor.",
        "statement": "Re-confirmed obsolete (superseded by REQ-0188's broader not-complete surfacing). The report-only classification behaviour still holds and req_0150 passes; not promoted.",
        "testing": {
          "actor": "Tom",
          "at": "2026-06-17T17:39:47.832161800Z",
          "outcome": "Pass",
          "references": [
