          "notes": "validation dossier concluded — REQ-0152 met: hash_files in src/commands/test_cmd.rs normalizes path separators to forward slash and strips CR before hashing, producing a platform-independent digest, verified by req_0152_hash_is_platform_independent unit test which passes at HEAD.",
          "outcome": "Pass"
        },
