    "REQ-0153": {
      "acceptance": [
        "refresh-anchors re-normalizes the content hash of a Verified ordinary requirement only when the legacy hash of its current source equals the stored hash.",
        "A requirement whose linked source genuinely changed is reported as drifted and is never rehashed.",
        "Verified safety requirements are never auto-refreshed; they are reported as needing a human re-anchor and co-sign.",
        "A --dry-run option reports what would change without writing."
      ],
