    "REQ-0155": {
      "acceptance": [
        "Linking a higher-SIL hazard to a safety function causes req conform to fail for each downstream safety requirement whose evidence predates the escalation.",
        "The error names the requirement, the evidence SIL, and the current inherited SIL.",
        "The error clears once the requirement is re-verified at the current SIL."
      ],
