      "id": "REQ-0156",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "IEC 61508 modification-phase impact analysis is exactly the bookkeeping a tool should automate rather than leave to a process document. A reviewer about to recalibrate the risk graph or relink a hazard currently has no way to see the downstream blast radius before committing to the change, so escalations are discovered only after the fact by a failing req conform.",
      "statement": "The tool shall provide a command that reports every safety artifact whose derived SIL would change as a result of a proposed hazard assessment, link, or calibration edit, without applying the edit.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "safety-impact",
        "safety"
      ],
