      "id": "REQ-0157",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Detecting stale-SIL evidence in the conformance checker is necessary but not sufficient; an agent or human starting a session needs the re-verification work pointed at them in the same place they already look for what to do next, otherwise the finding sits unread until a CI run trips over it.",
      "statement": "The session brief shall list the safety requirements that need re-verification because their inherited SIL rose above the SIL recorded on their latest evidence.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "safety-impact",
