      "id": "REQ-0159",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "The merge driver currently rewrites only requirement-to-requirement links, so after a merge that renumbers a hazard or safety function its inbound mitigates and realizes links are left pointing at the old identifier. The result is a dangling safety link that survives until the next req conform run, undermining the trace guarantee the safety layer is built to provide.",
      "statement": "The renumber command shall rewrite mitigates and realizes link targets whenever a hazard, safety-function, or safety-requirement identifier is reassigned.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "safety-lifecycle",
        "safety"
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "actor": "Claude (agent)",
