      "id": "REQ-0161",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "A forced, irregular transition such as Verified back to Draft currently accepts an empty or single-character reason, making a legitimate documented correction indistinguishable from a careless override in the audit trail. A minimum-substance check raises the cost of a thoughtless force without blocking genuine ones.",
      "statement": "The conformance checker shall reject a forced status change whose reason is shorter than a configurable minimum length.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "evidence"
      ],
