      "id": "REQ-0163",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "A large project returns its entire filtered requirement set as a single array today, which burns an agent's context window or forces it to guess filters blindly. Offset and limit with a reported total let an agent page through a backlog deterministically without holding the whole spec in context.",
      "statement": "The list command shall return a bounded page of matching requirements selected by a caller-supplied offset and limit, reporting the total match count separately.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "agent-surface"
      ],
