      "id": "REQ-0165",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "An agent that hits the verification-dossier gate currently receives a bare refusal without being told that the staged dossier flow, the no-dossier waiver, and the exempt tag are the three legal ways forward. Listing the routes in the rejection turns a dead end into a self-service fix.",
      "statement": "The tool shall return the available routes to a valid Verified state whenever it rejects a verification promotion for want of a passing dossier.",
