      "id": "REQ-0167",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Every agent mutation is attributed to a generic agent actor kind today, which flattens exactly the accountability a reviewer or safety assessor needs. Capturing the responsible human alongside the acting agent restores a meaningful chain of accountability for agent-choreographed work and is a prerequisite for any future independence model.",
      "statement": "The tool shall let an agent record the identity of the human on whose behalf a mutation is made and preserve that identity in the history entry alongside the agent actor.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "attribution"
      ],
