      "id": "REQ-0169",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "A human about to sign off on a safety argument needs to understand the safety need and the way it has been met, traced from the hazard through the safety function to the requirement and its evidence, rather than inspecting disconnected artifacts. Assembling the whole chain into one guided sequence is what lets a reviewer form a defensible judgement before accepting.",
      "statement": "The tool shall provide a guided review command that presents each in-scope safety requirement together with its originating hazard, mitigating safety function, and verification evidence as a single ordered walkthrough.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "guided-review",
        "safety"
      ],
