      "id": "REQ-0170",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Presenting the chain is only half of an informed review; the reviewer must actively confirm understanding of each requirement so that acceptance is a series of considered decisions rather than a single bulk approval. A per-requirement gate forces the reviewer to engage with every link in the chain.",
      "statement": "The guided safety walkthrough shall require the reviewer to explicitly acknowledge each safety requirement before it advances to the next one.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "guided-review",
        "safety"
      ],
