      "id": "REQ-0176",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "An external test system integrates against a contract, and that contract must be able to evolve without silently breaking existing benches. A published, versioned schema lets a test runner check its integration for conformance and lets the tool reject payloads written against an incompatible version.",
      "statement": "The tool shall publish a versioned schema for both the exported test-request payload and the accepted test-result payload.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration"
      ],
