      "id": "REQ-0177",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Closing the loop on bench automation means results flow back into project.req without a human retyping them. Ingesting a structured result payload and attaching each outcome as a test record keeps the external evidence on the same footing as locally-captured evidence and inside the same integrity-protected file.",
      "statement": "The tool shall accept a test-result payload from an external system and attach each result to its requirement as a test record.",
