      "id": "REQ-0178",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "An external bench is an untrusted input source, and a partially-applied or malformed result set would corrupt the evidence trail. Conformance-checking the whole payload before writing anything keeps ingestion transactional, so a bad submission leaves project.req byte-identical to its prior state.",
      "statement": "The tool shall check an ingested test-result payload for conformance against its schema and reject a malformed payload before any test record is written.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration"
      ],
