      "id": "REQ-0179",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Evidence captured from a physical bench is only trustworthy if its source is attributable, so a reviewer can tell which rig under which configuration produced a result. Stamping the system identity and environment onto each ingested record preserves that provenance for audit and for distinguishing automated bench evidence from local runs.",
      "statement": "The tool shall record the identity of the originating test system and its test environment as provenance on each ingested test record.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration"
      ],
