      "id": "REQ-0180",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The evidence model's staleness guard rests on the commit join key, and external results must participate in it or they would appear permanently fresh regardless of code changes. Recording the commit the bench tested against lets an ingested result go stale exactly as a local record would when the code moves on.",
      "statement": "The tool shall bind each ingested test result to the commit identifier supplied by the external system so that staleness is tracked against the code under test.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration",
        "evidence"
      ],
