      "id": "REQ-0181",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The AugTronic test orchestrator already exposes a complete per-firmware verification export over an OAuth-protected HTTP endpoint, but an agent must currently download it and transcribe the verdicts into project.req by hand, which is the manual route-back this integration exists to remove. A built-in authenticated pull turns the closing leg of the loop into one command and keeps the bench results on the same integrity-protected footing as local evidence.",
      "statement": "The tool shall provide a command that retrieves a per-firmware verification export from an authenticated external test-system endpoint and ingests its verdicts in a single operation.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration",
        "at-test"
      ],
