      "id": "REQ-0182",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The external orchestrator emits pass, fail, error, bench_cap_suspected, and operator_override, which do not correspond one-to-one with the local pass-or-fail record model. A declared and versioned mapping keeps ingestion honest about what each external verdict means, so a bench-capability-limited result is never silently recorded as a clean pass.",
      "statement": "The tool shall translate an external test system's verdict vocabulary into its own test-result model through a declared, versioned mapping.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration",
        "at-test"
      ],
