      "id": "REQ-0183",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The external orchestrator holds, per commit and requirement, exactly the plan, analysis, and statement triad that the local verification dossier expects, joined on the same commit-and-requirement key this tool already uses. Reusing that decision lets external evidence flow into the dossier instead of being re-authored by hand, while the matching-commit guard stops a decision made against one firmware from being attached to another.",
      "statement": "The tool shall populate a requirement's verification dossier from an external system's plan, analysis, and decision when their anchoring commit matches the dossier anchor.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "test-integration",
        "at-test",
        "evidence"
      ],
