      "id": "REQ-0185",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "The report currently lists only verified items and their provenance class, so a project with unverified or unplanned requirements shows nothing about them and the reader cannot judge coverage from the report at all. Enumerating the unverified requirements, grouped by their stage in the plan-analysis-test-conclude pipeline, turns a verified-only listing into a complete coverage picture that shows what work remains.",
      "statement": "The verification-provenance report shall enumerate every requirement that has not reached a passing verification, grouped by how far it has progressed through the dossier pipeline.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "evidence",
        "verification-report"
      ],
