      "id": "REQ-0187",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "Today conclude --promote flips a safety requirement straight to Verified, where it immediately trips REQ-V-0034 (genuine dossier, no human co-sign) as a hard error until a human confirms. Because an agent cannot confirm, the requirement is stuck in a blocking-error resting state with no way to commit. Making the human co-sign the act that promotes removes the unreachable state while preserving the guarantee that Verified always implies a human signed off.",
      "statement": "For a safety requirement, req verification conclude --promote shall record the genuine concluded dossier and verification evidence but leave the requirement at Implemented in an awaiting-human-confirmation state; promotion to Verified shall be performed only by req verification confirm, which a human runs.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "safety",
        "verification"
      ],
