    "REQ-0188": {
      "acceptance": [
        "req verification report lists each safety requirement awaiting human co-sign under a distinct pending-confirmation category even though its status is Implemented.",
        "req conform emits a non-blocking advisory, not a hard error, naming each safety requirement awaiting human co-sign so the gate surfaces it without blocking the commit.",
        "req sreq list and req sreq show mark such a requirement as awaiting confirmation rather than plain implemented.",
        "No view reports a safety requirement awaiting co-sign as verified or complete.",
        "req verification report enumerates every safety requirement together with its verification standing regardless of status, so no safety requirement is ever omitted by a status filter."
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-14T13:44:30.468029900Z",
