      "acceptance": [
        "A new command runs the whole-project well-formedness check under a non-V&V name that does not clash with existing commands (check, lint, review, precheck, doctor).",
        "The former name `req validate` is not retained as an alias — the rename to `req conform` is a clean pre-release break, and `req validate` errors as an unrecognized subcommand.",
        "README, help text, git hooks and CI reference the new name."
