      "id": "REQ-0196",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "req overloads safety vocabulary (verify, validate, validation, verified). A single authoritative glossary, grounded in the standards, gives agents and humans one place to learn what each word means in req and prevents the definitions drifting apart across commands and docs.",
      "statement": "req shall maintain a single safety-terminology reference, reachable as a help section, that defines each IEC 61508 / ISO 26262 term req uses, including verification, validation, conformance, and the Verified state.",
