    "REQ-0199": {
      "acceptance": [
        "The left and right arrow keys move to the previous and next in-scope safety requirement.",
        "A single keypress acknowledges or objects to the current safety requirement, applying the same human-only (REQ-0173) and chain-completeness (REQ-0174) rules as the non-interactive command.",
        "A keypress quits the walkthrough.",
        "The interactive mode operates over exactly the targeted scope (HAZ/SF/SR filter or whole project).",
        "When standard input or output is not a terminal the command falls back to the non-interactive rendering, leaving agents, pipes, and CI unaffected."
      ],
