      "id": "REQ-0199",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "A human reviewing a safety case wants to move through the requirements and accept or object without retyping a command per item; an arrow-key navigator with single-key accept/object makes the review efficient while keeping the human-only guarantee (a TTY is inherently human).",
      "statement": "The guided safety walkthrough shall provide an interactive terminal mode for stepping through the in-scope safety requirements and recording the human's decision in place.",
      "status": "Verified",
      "tags": [
        "safety"
      ],
