    "REQ-0200": {
      "acceptance": [
        "req verification reverify --by-tests runs (or ingests via --from-file) the test suite once and, for each STALE Verified ordinary requirement whose req_NNNN_* tests all pass, re-anchors its dossier (analysis+testing pass, content hash recomputed at HEAD) so its provenance becomes genuine.",
        "Safety requirements are never re-anchored by this command; they are reported and left for the human co-sign path.",
        "An ordinary requirement with no matching test, or with any failing test, is left stale and reported, never auto-accepted.",
        "The recorded statement makes clear the evidence is the passing test run at the current commit, not a fresh code review."
      ],
