    "REQ-0204": {
      "acceptance": [
        "A safety function's verification dossier requires a coverage note per realizing SR (req verification cover) and refuses to conclude until every realizing SR is Verified",
        "A hazard's staged adequacy dossier (req hazard adequacy plan/cover/conclude) requires a coverage note per mitigating SF and refuses to conclude until every mitigating SF is Verified",
        "The chain is anchored so adding/removing a child or re-verifying one drifts the parent stale; conform reports REQ-V-0044 (SF) and REQ-V-0045 (hazard) when a Verified parent's chain is broken",
        "The human co-sign re-checks the chain gate so a chain that drifted since conclude cannot be silently signed off"
      ],
