    "REQ-0208": {
      "acceptance": [
        "The command exposes the full requirement set and the due-for-verification subset over authenticated HTTP GET endpoints",
        "Every endpoint requires a bearer token, and a request without the valid token is rejected before any project data is read or written",
        "A result submitted to the endpoint is recorded as staged verification evidence covering plan, analysis and testing, with no verdict or statement set, so promotion to Verified remains a later human step",
        "The command holds an exclusive lock on the project file for its lifetime, so at most one server runs against a given project.req",
        "A malformed or unauthenticated request leaves project.req byte-identical to its prior state"
      ],
      "created": "2026-07-09T14:37:22.610911776Z",
      "history": [
