            "note": "SR-0010 is the complete realization of SF-0009: it requires the merge driver to preserve both sides and fail loud (non-zero, git conflict) on any unresolvable divergence, and to register without an exit-status mask. With SR-0010 Verified, the safe-state of SF-0009 (no spec mutation accepted from an unreconcilable merge) is enforced. SR-0010 is currently awaiting human co-sign.",
