        "plan": "Argue SF-0009 (spec merges fail safe) is adequately implemented by its realizing safety requirement SR-0010: the merge driver auto-merges non-conflicting changes and surfaces any unresolvable divergence as a git conflict, never silently choosing a side. Evidence is SR-0010's verification plus the coverage walk-through below.",
