    "SR-0005": {
      "acceptance": [
        "No CLI command outside the V&V evidence workflow uses validate, verify, validation or verification in its name.",
        "The analysis-plus-test evidence dossier is described as verification (conformance) terminating in Verified; the human safety co-sign is described as an independent verification review, not as validation (which is out of scope).",
        "A reviewer can map each user-facing V&V usage to verification (build-it-right) or validation (build-the-right-thing)."
      ],
